8ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:821368","original":"MAT队使用的直升机，使用两侧的螺旋桨提供动力，兼备战斗和运输等等功能，配备了一柄加特林机枪。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","title":"マットジャイロ"}],"score":-13.000598831982527,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:937374","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:937374","original":"琼安·弗洛加特，1980年8月21日出生于英国，演员。\r\n在ITV最新的古典剧《唐顿庄园》中饰演Anna Anna是女仆的领班，低级女仆中职位最高的一个。2015年，琼安凭借《唐顿庄园》获得第72届美国金球奖的电视类最佳女配角奖 。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"Joanne Froggatt"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"person","namespace":"bangumi.person","value":"26006"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:937374","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:937374","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"person"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:937374","original":"琼安·弗洛加特，1980年8月21日出生于英国，演员。\r\n在ITV最新的古典剧《唐顿庄园》中饰演Anna Anna是女仆的领班，低级女仆中职位最高的一个。2015年，琼安凭借《唐顿庄园》获得第72届美国金球奖的电视类最佳女配角奖 。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","title":"Joanne Froggatt"}],"score":-13.000598831982527,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:662740","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:662740","original":"乔原本是一个无忧无虑的花季少女，家境富裕，在父亲的宠爱下长大。父亲忽然死于保卫者公司之手，自己也惨遭毒手。庆幸被精通植物学的青年医生本软所救，并因用植物药剂而获得异能。\r\n为了复仇，乔身份加入kak，骗取加特琳的信任，成为崭露头角的新星。在kak内，她认识了与自己有着相似遭遇的lia，同时也发现了更多的敌人，包括杀害自己父母的幕后黑手之一曹四光，绑架lia的幕后真凶等。\r\n在自己身份暴露后，乔与加特琳决裂，并与lia携手，联合本软、黑则武，以及其他反对加特琳和曹四光的力量，向着这群罪孽深重的势力发起了战斗！","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"魅惑《藤女》画集"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"subject","namespace":"bangumi.subject","value":"679151"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:662740","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:662740","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"subject"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:662740","original":"乔原本是一个无忧无虑的花季少女，家境富裕，在父亲的宠爱下长大。父亲忽然死于保卫者公司之手，自己也惨遭毒手。庆幸被精通植物学的青年医生本软所救，并因用植物药剂而获得异能。\r\n为了复仇，乔身份加入kak，骗取加特琳的信任，成为崭露头角的新星。在kak内，她认识了与自己有着相似遭遇的lia，同时也发现了更多的敌人，包括杀害自己父母的幕后黑手之一曹四光，绑架lia的幕后真凶等。\r\n在自己身份暴露后，乔与加特琳决裂，并与lia携手，联合本软、黑则武，以及其他反对加特琳和曹四光的力量，向着这群罪孽深重的势力发起了战斗！","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","title":"魅惑《藤女》画集"}],"score":-12.734005339130183,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"canonical":{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"e